{
  "$comment": "Influencer overlay on engine/specs/compliance-rules.json. The engine owns disclosure_labels per market; this file adds the labels (and narrows them where a market rule is stricter: DE treats a bare #ad as weak, FR engine rule FR-INFLUENCER-LAW accepts only Publicité or Collaboration commerciale), weak tags, licences, payout and outreach rules that only creator work needs. Planning summary as of October 2026, not legal advice (docs/markets.md).",
